Fact citizen  Identified by Alice, Bob, Chloe
Fact minister Identified by "Minister van Volkshuisvesting"

Fact permit      Identified by citizen
Fact permit-type Identified by "solar panels", "new construction"
Fact application Identified by citizen * permit-type

Act apply
  Actor citizen
  Recipient minister
  Related to permit-type
  Creates 
    application(citizen, permit-type)

Act deny
  Actor minister
  Recipient citizen
  Related to application
  Conditioned by 
    application && 
    application.citizen == citizen &&
    application.permit-type == "new construction"
  Terminates
    application

Act approve
  Actor minister
  Recipient citizen
  Related to application
  Conditioned by 
    application &&
    application.citizen == citizen &&
    application.permit-type == "solar panels"
  Terminates
    application
  Creates
    permit(citizen).

// init

+apply.
+deny.
+approve.

// scenario

apply(Chloe, minister, "solar panels").
approve(minister, Chloe, application(Chloe, "solar panels")).
apply(Bob, minister, "new construction").
deny(minister, Bob, application(Bob, "new construction")).
apply(Alice, minister, "solar panels").
deny(minister, Alice, application(Alice, "solar panels")). //non-compliant
